  "canonicalAdditions": [
    "Supported real-time production quotation workflows across up to 12 insurers, with integrated policy issuance.",
    "Historical production analytics recorded real-user activity. I recall a peak of approximately 15,000 distinct users within one hour; the original dashboard is not available for independent corroboration. This is an approximate historical recollection, not a concurrency, request-throughput or load-test measurement.",
    "Supported configurable leave calculations for different organizational policies and employee populations.",
    "Supported leave-calculation rules that could vary by organization and apply to an individual employee, a selected group or the whole workforce. Configuration planning prioritized likely and urgent policy changes within available resources and operational constraints.",
    "Delivered browser-based meetings with recordings and operational reports while supporting established education workflows.",
    "Delivered browser-based meetings for older supported browsers, with recordings, meeting-activity telemetry and operational reporting. The meeting solution used AWS Chime and Amazon S3; compatibility was balanced against implementation and infrastructure constraints.",
    "Integrated external applications through controlled HRMS APIs; occasional professional collaboration continues.",
    "Prioritized system flexibility so changing employee roles and responsibilities could be accommodated as organizational headcount and operational needs evolved. Designed modular service boundaries to support authenticated API interfaces around selected capabilities.",
    "External applications were integrated through APIs built around existing service capabilities. Authentication and permission checks restricted access to sensitive HRMS records and protected workflows.",
    "Evidence"
  ],
